{
  "name": "Surface Integrity (composite objective on the public surface)",
  "description": "The cards a visitor sees at gaius.zndx.org are current, clean, and conserved: newest visible date within newest_days; at least min_current_share of the first band cards within current_days; top card published within refresh_hours; no marketing/aggregation shape, no goggle-discarded domain, no duplicate source URL among published cards; no published→archived transition in the window without a declared-category reason. Verdicts are pass|fail|error per gate, never inconclusive; each FAIL names the DAG stage; the flip is the smallest declared action that restores PASS.",
  "modality": "Structured facts (JSON) collected from the live page, collections.cards, the Brave goggle and collections.card_events",
  "diagram": null,
